Subject: [PATCH] Apple spatial audio eligibility, session ownership and diagnostics

Enable mono/stereo and multichannel spatialization on both native audio paths.
Keep user head-tracking preferences authoritative. Preserve host session lifetime
and paused state through output changes. Report native renderer readback without
claiming Atmos or head tracking. Recover compressed audio to PCM for processing.

